WEBVTT

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:19.320
A light so bright that it can't be hidden
Breaks the silence and resurrects in this world

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:30.070
The dry land quakes violently
Sparks clash as we risk our lives

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:37.790
Let a miracle occur, just one more time

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:44.950
The power to regain the pages of memories I lost long ago

00:00:45.870 --> 00:00:53.020
The trusting heart pierces the darkness
Search for the place where the soul rests

00:00:53.150 --> 00:00:59.250
The sharp glint in my unblinking eye burns

00:00:59.550 --> 00:01:06.700
Two souls - light and shadow
To the future shown in the crystal

00:01:06.890 --> 00:01:13.310
Now moving  Overflowing in red  eyes

00:01:29.600 --> 00:01:35.840
Bakura's strategy is to split us apart until Zorc resurrects.

00:01:35.840 --> 00:01:38.840
Karim was defeated.

00:01:38.840 --> 00:01:42.040
I can't lose any more of my friends.

00:01:42.040 --> 00:01:47.940
I must rescue Seto from Great Shadow Magus and prevent Zorc's resurrection.

00:01:47.940 --> 00:01:51.900
Partner, find my name as soon as possible!

00:01:53.580 --> 00:01:59.600
White Dragon

00:02:07.610 --> 00:02:10.020
The Pharaoh’s name is in here.

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:11.740
Honda!

00:02:12.060 --> 00:02:13.900
Wait up, Honda!

00:02:19.060 --> 00:02:20.480
This is...

00:02:22.420 --> 00:02:25.300
There's nothing here!

00:02:26.160 --> 00:02:29.900
Is the other Yugi's name really here?

00:02:29.900 --> 00:02:30.940
Definitely!

00:02:33.180 --> 00:02:34.740
But…

00:02:36.180 --> 00:02:37.680
Here it is, Yugi!

00:02:37.680 --> 00:02:38.440
What?

00:02:39.200 --> 00:02:40.580
Where?

00:02:41.140 --> 00:02:42.180
Right here.

00:02:43.070 --> 00:02:44.580
Really?

00:02:45.900 --> 00:02:48.600
What does it say?

00:02:48.600 --> 00:02:50.860
To the solver of the Millennium Puzzle…

00:02:50.860 --> 00:02:56.340
...give back what you wished for and acquired to open the doorway.

00:02:57.080 --> 00:02:59.360
Honda, why can you read it?

00:02:59.360 --> 00:03:01.480
That's not important!

00:03:01.480 --> 00:03:07.500
Yugi, the Millennium Puzzle has the power to grant the wish of the one who solved it.

00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:10.980
Honda, did you really read it?

00:03:10.980 --> 00:03:13.520
Yugi, hurry up and give it back.

00:03:13.520 --> 00:03:16.380
Don’t you care what happens to the other Yugi?

00:03:16.380 --> 00:03:22.160
What I received from the Millennium Puzzle was...

00:03:22.160 --> 00:03:25.140
Seto, accept your destiny.

00:03:25.140 --> 00:03:28.150
The Pharaoh and our destinies are light and dark.

00:03:28.150 --> 00:03:32.400
When the dark power awakens, the world will enter a new age.

00:03:32.400 --> 00:03:37.280
Seto, become the new Pharaoh and rule this land!

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:40.320
Where am I?

00:03:41.520 --> 00:03:43.280
Aknadin!

00:03:43.280 --> 00:03:45.360
Look, Seto.

00:03:46.520 --> 00:03:50.940
A new god's power proves there'll be a new Pharaoh.

00:03:50.940 --> 00:03:53.940
That messenger is heading this way.

00:04:06.360 --> 00:04:07.420
Kisara!

00:04:07.920 --> 00:04:12.040
Seto, destiny wants you to be the Pharaoh.

00:04:31.700 --> 00:04:32.580
Kisara!

00:04:34.920 --> 00:04:36.160
Seto!

00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:40.300
Kisara, what are you doing here?

00:04:40.300 --> 00:04:43.560
Your village was destroyed because you chose to save me.

00:04:44.120 --> 00:04:46.560
So it’s my turn to save you.

00:04:46.930 --> 00:04:48.490
Kisara...

00:04:50.860 --> 00:04:52.580
That man…

00:04:55.800 --> 00:04:58.780
The one who has the White Dragon has arrived.

00:04:58.780 --> 00:05:02.020
To give Seto proof that he's the Pharaoh.

00:05:02.380 --> 00:05:05.280
His heart is full of evil.

00:05:05.280 --> 00:05:08.970
Seto, don't do what he says.

00:05:13.610 --> 00:05:15.950
Zorc’s resurrection will soon begin.

00:05:15.950 --> 00:05:17.810
Seto, kill her!

00:05:17.810 --> 00:05:20.810
That's the ritual to make you a god!

00:05:20.810 --> 00:05:24.530
My son, get the White Dragon and become the Pharaoh!

00:05:24.530 --> 00:05:29.580
Aknadin, even if you're my father, I won’t sell my soul to the darkness!

00:05:30.100 --> 00:05:31.700
Let's go, Kisara.

00:05:31.700 --> 00:05:32.580
Okay.

00:05:33.870 --> 00:05:39.000
Seto, you cannot escape our destiny!

00:05:45.130 --> 00:05:46.500
Duos!

00:05:50.040 --> 00:05:51.880
Aura Sword!

00:05:57.970 --> 00:06:00.050
Seto!

00:06:03.870 --> 00:06:06.290
You won’t go one step further!

00:06:07.440 --> 00:06:08.610
Duos!

00:06:12.270 --> 00:06:15.020
My son, come to your senses!

00:06:18.920 --> 00:06:20.060
Duos!

00:06:23.980 --> 00:06:25.080
Seto!

00:06:25.080 --> 00:06:28.080
Vessel, it's all your fault.

00:06:28.080 --> 00:06:30.700
You're tricking my son!

00:06:32.080 --> 00:06:34.590
I won’t lose Seto to you!

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:47.020
Its power rivals the gods!

00:06:47.020 --> 00:06:49.100
White Dragon...

00:06:50.580 --> 00:06:52.430
Blue-Eyes?

00:06:55.320 --> 00:06:57.030
That's...

00:06:57.030 --> 00:06:59.200
There you are, Seto!

00:07:10.340 --> 00:07:11.320
Kisara!

00:07:33.660 --> 00:07:35.390
Don't, Kisara!

00:07:35.390 --> 00:07:37.220
You’ll run out of Ba.

00:07:37.220 --> 00:07:38.490
I don't mind.

00:07:38.490 --> 00:07:39.050
What?

00:07:39.050 --> 00:07:43.260
As long as I can protect you.

00:07:44.110 --> 00:07:44.900
Kisara...

00:07:44.900 --> 00:07:46.910
What are you doing, Seto?

00:07:46.910 --> 00:07:50.920
Kill her and acquire the White Dragon's power!

00:07:50.920 --> 00:07:55.200
Use that power to serve Zorc and become the Dark Pharaoh!

00:07:55.200 --> 00:07:57.200
You’re making a mistake!

00:07:57.200 --> 00:08:02.700
Aknadin, what's the point of a dark world ruled by Zorc?

00:08:02.700 --> 00:08:09.260
By meeting Kisara, I learned that no matter how dark and barren the world may become...

00:08:09.260 --> 00:08:13.220
...the light of love can shine through the darkness.

00:08:13.220 --> 00:08:14.700
Seto…

00:08:14.700 --> 00:08:16.410
You fool.

00:08:17.080 --> 00:08:23.230
You could've changed our lineage of losers!

00:08:24.160 --> 00:08:28.020
Kisara and I aren't your tools for revenge!

00:08:28.020 --> 00:08:34.220
My honorable father bravely died on the battlefield long ago.

00:08:34.220 --> 00:08:36.240
Seto!

00:08:43.530 --> 00:08:44.400
Kisara!

00:08:44.400 --> 00:08:48.190
As long as I have this Ka, I don't need you!

00:08:48.460 --> 00:08:51.740
Kisara!

00:08:51.740 --> 00:08:53.240
Seto…

00:08:54.170 --> 00:08:55.760
Kisara!

00:08:55.760 --> 00:08:57.180
Kisara!

00:09:02.650 --> 00:09:06.460
If I fired at you, I knew she’d protect you.

00:09:07.730 --> 00:09:10.240
A new Pharaoh will now rise.

00:09:10.240 --> 00:09:13.490
Seto, you are the chosen Pharaoh.

00:09:13.490 --> 00:09:17.020
Kill the Pharaoh and fill the world with darkness!

00:09:19.530 --> 00:09:22.680
Yes.  Join me, my son.

00:09:25.180 --> 00:09:29.580
My father died when I was a child!

00:09:33.900 --> 00:09:36.500
This is your answer?

00:09:37.940 --> 00:09:41.130
Your flesh and blood come from me.

00:09:41.130 --> 00:09:45.130
For my final act, I give you my power and soul.

00:09:45.470 --> 00:09:50.650
My son, I loved you with all my heart.

00:09:51.160 --> 00:09:57.870
Let your blood be filled with my love and hate for the Pharaoh.

00:09:57.870 --> 00:10:04.690
Become one with my soul and become the Dark Pharaoh, Seto!

00:10:14.220 --> 00:10:15.490
Yugi?

00:10:15.740 --> 00:10:17.170
Seto!

00:10:19.260 --> 00:10:20.900
Are you okay?

00:10:20.900 --> 00:10:23.540
I’ve been waiting for you, Pharaoh.

00:10:23.540 --> 00:10:26.680
Zorc’s resurrection is near.

00:10:26.680 --> 00:10:30.680
I'll defeat you here and become the new Pharaoh.

00:10:30.680 --> 00:10:33.080
What are you talking about, Seto?

00:10:36.330 --> 00:10:37.960
Who is she?

00:10:39.180 --> 00:10:41.680
Blue-Eyes’s tablet?

00:10:41.680 --> 00:10:45.090
What happened?  Where's Aknadin?

00:10:52.450 --> 00:10:56.690
Pharaoh, I’m inside Seto’s soul.

00:10:59.770 --> 00:11:04.540
I'll defeat you here and become the Dark Pharaoh!

00:11:04.970 --> 00:11:08.450
Seto has clearly lost his mind.

00:11:08.450 --> 00:11:10.560
Did Aknadin do this?

00:11:10.560 --> 00:11:13.560
It's time for my wishes to come true.

00:11:13.560 --> 00:11:18.920
My son, bury the Pharaoh with the power of your White Dragon!

00:11:19.400 --> 00:11:20.800
Diaha!

00:11:35.840 --> 00:11:37.210
Stop, Seto!

00:11:37.210 --> 00:11:38.960
You’re being controlled!

00:11:38.960 --> 00:11:43.300
Pharaoh, behold the power of my god that shakes the heavens!

00:11:43.300 --> 00:11:46.000
Come out, White Dragon!

00:11:59.820 --> 00:12:01.730
I have no choice but to fight.

00:12:01.730 --> 00:12:05.360
Come out!  My servant, Dark Magician!

00:12:10.210 --> 00:12:12.780
Feel our hatred in this attack!

00:12:13.650 --> 00:12:17.050
I'll put all my Heka into this attack!

00:12:19.050 --> 00:12:20.560
Light of Destruction!

00:12:21.290 --> 00:12:22.970
Magical Shockwave!

00:12:27.700 --> 00:12:30.010
Pharaoh!

00:12:33.140 --> 00:12:34.640
Mahad!

00:12:36.530 --> 00:12:41.290
Pharaoh, you're like an emperor with no clothes.

00:12:44.010 --> 00:12:47.910
Prepare to die, son of Aknamkanon!

00:12:48.290 --> 00:12:50.420
Seto, can you hear me?

00:12:50.420 --> 00:12:54.770
Have you forgotten the light inside your heart?

00:12:54.770 --> 00:12:57.790
Have you forgotten your duty to defend this kingdom?

00:12:57.790 --> 00:13:03.310
You're going to live as a king imprisoned inside your soul?

00:13:03.650 --> 00:13:05.800
All your talk is pointless.

00:13:05.800 --> 00:13:08.810
White Dragon, kill the Pharaoh!

00:13:11.800 --> 00:13:14.440
Ki...sa...ra…

00:13:19.290 --> 00:13:21.980
White Dragon!  Why?

00:13:21.980 --> 00:13:23.980
Why won't it attack?

00:13:28.000 --> 00:13:30.890
Blue-Eyes is vanishing.

00:13:32.780 --> 00:13:34.890
What's this light?

00:13:42.080 --> 00:13:43.570
Impossible…

00:13:46.700 --> 00:13:49.710
Seto!

00:13:56.190 --> 00:14:01.290
Seto, don't let darkness overtake your heart.

00:14:11.980 --> 00:14:13.310
Kisara!

00:14:20.010 --> 00:14:21.440
Kisara…

00:14:28.820 --> 00:14:29.840
Yugi…

00:14:30.720 --> 00:14:33.930
Kaiba, you're here too?

00:14:33.930 --> 00:14:39.350
The unconscious fools in front of the tablet, Bakura's occult items...

00:14:39.350 --> 00:14:42.860
...the vision I saw when I battled you at the Duel Tower…

00:14:42.860 --> 00:14:50.160
According to your occult nonsense, this is the world 3,000 years ago.

00:14:50.160 --> 00:14:51.150
However...

00:14:51.150 --> 00:14:54.910
It's slightly different than the vision I saw.

00:14:54.910 --> 00:15:00.920
This world is a Shadow Game built from my memories 3,000 years ago.

00:15:00.920 --> 00:15:04.490
It may be slightly different from how it actually was.

00:15:05.050 --> 00:15:06.590
A Shadow Game?

00:15:06.590 --> 00:15:09.180
It's your choice whether you believe it or not.

00:15:09.180 --> 00:15:13.680
But Zorc will soon resurrect in this world.

00:15:13.680 --> 00:15:15.680
Leave this world immediately!

00:15:15.680 --> 00:15:18.900
I’m sure you can find a way out!

00:15:18.900 --> 00:15:23.200
You may have status in this world, but I take orders from no one.

00:15:23.650 --> 00:15:28.350
I want to see what kind of evil scares even you.

00:15:28.920 --> 00:15:30.370
Kaiba…

00:15:32.140 --> 00:15:35.630
Unbelievable.  He was useless.

00:15:35.630 --> 00:15:38.750
I didn't think Great Shadow Magus would lose.

00:15:38.750 --> 00:15:42.290
Your plan to get Seto on your side failed.

00:15:42.290 --> 00:15:44.490
Don’t get cocky, Yugi.

00:15:44.490 --> 00:15:50.160
The sand in The Hourglass of Evil is still counting down to your death.

00:15:50.160 --> 00:15:53.430
Your defeat is assured.

00:15:53.870 --> 00:15:56.060
Zorc…

00:15:56.060 --> 00:16:00.980
When that hourglass runs out, this world will face true horror.

00:16:00.980 --> 00:16:03.460
Its power is unfathomable.

00:16:03.460 --> 00:16:08.710
But even if Zorc resurrects, there must be a way to defeat it.

00:16:08.710 --> 00:16:10.340
It's by...

00:16:11.940 --> 00:16:17.150
Seems you figured out how to seal up Zorc.

00:16:17.150 --> 00:16:22.280
Since this is a Shadow Game, there's a method to defeat anyone.

00:16:22.280 --> 00:16:27.580
As we near the end, there's only one thing that hasn’t been revealed.

00:16:27.580 --> 00:16:29.620
My name!

00:16:30.010 --> 00:16:37.870
3,000 years ago, I used my name and soul to seal Zorc in the door to the afterlife.

00:16:37.870 --> 00:16:41.890
Which means my name is the key to sealing Zorc!

00:16:42.880 --> 00:16:48.890
Unfortunately for you, you don't know where your name is hidden.

00:16:50.080 --> 00:16:53.940
But let me give you a glimmer of hope.

00:16:53.940 --> 00:17:00.410
Your four friends entered your royal tomb to search for the Pharaoh’s name.

00:17:00.410 --> 00:17:02.030
My friends?

00:17:02.480 --> 00:17:08.040
Only those your heart allows can enter the tomb.

00:17:08.040 --> 00:17:09.900
Why are you telling me?

00:17:09.900 --> 00:17:15.260
Despair is more damaging when you lose hope.

00:17:15.260 --> 00:17:21.040
The moment your friends learn your name, my servant will kill them.

00:17:21.040 --> 00:17:23.610
Your servant?

00:17:23.610 --> 00:17:25.930
He’s infiltrated your friends.

00:17:25.930 --> 00:17:30.540
The one I used Parasite Mind on.

00:17:31.920 --> 00:17:34.210
Yugi, tell us!

00:17:34.210 --> 00:17:38.350
What did you get when you solved the Millennium Puzzle?

00:17:38.760 --> 00:17:40.400
It's…

00:17:40.980 --> 00:17:43.540
I want friends!

00:17:43.540 --> 00:17:46.440
Yugi!  Let's duel!

00:17:46.880 --> 00:17:49.020
Yugi!  Run!

00:17:49.710 --> 00:17:51.880
Let's go together, Yugi!

00:17:52.530 --> 00:17:53.850
It's...

00:17:54.260 --> 00:17:56.400
Yugi, do you mean...

00:17:56.400 --> 00:17:57.980
...us?

00:17:57.980 --> 00:17:59.130
Is that right?

00:18:04.410 --> 00:18:05.410
Hey!

00:18:09.210 --> 00:18:10.200
Hey!

00:18:10.200 --> 00:18:11.400
What are you doing?

00:18:27.850 --> 00:18:29.160
What's going on?

00:18:36.050 --> 00:18:39.550
That room has the Pharaoh’s name.

00:18:39.550 --> 00:18:40.340
I get it!

00:18:41.030 --> 00:18:42.960
"Give back what you acquired."

00:18:42.960 --> 00:18:47.050
If Yugi goes into that room, since we're on the other side of this scale...

00:18:48.490 --> 00:18:50.170
Go, Yugi!

00:18:50.540 --> 00:18:55.050
There's no way I can do that.

00:18:55.600 --> 00:18:57.580
I figured as much, Yugi.

00:18:57.910 --> 00:19:02.980
You’re too kind to sacrifice your friends.

00:19:02.980 --> 00:19:03.920
Honda?

00:19:03.920 --> 00:19:05.920
So I’ll do it for you!

00:19:12.180 --> 00:19:13.050
Yugi!

00:19:13.050 --> 00:19:15.560
Get over here!  Run!

00:19:20.090 --> 00:19:21.040
Yugi!

00:19:30.120 --> 00:19:32.650
Yugi!  Climb up!

00:19:35.810 --> 00:19:36.920
Yugi!

00:19:40.450 --> 00:19:41.550
Jonouchi!

00:19:44.560 --> 00:19:45.940
That was close.

00:19:45.940 --> 00:19:46.860
Let’s go!

00:19:52.810 --> 00:19:54.140
There it is!

00:19:56.830 --> 00:19:59.440
It's my other self's…

00:19:59.440 --> 00:20:01.010
...real name.

00:20:01.380 --> 00:20:02.340
All right!

00:20:02.340 --> 00:20:04.370
I’ve memorized it.

00:20:05.980 --> 00:20:07.580
But where’s Honda?

00:20:08.370 --> 00:20:09.920
Yugi!  Jonouchi!

00:20:11.010 --> 00:20:12.190
Look!

00:20:13.500 --> 00:20:14.900
An escape route?

00:20:17.020 --> 00:20:19.470
Honda!  Where'd you go?

00:20:20.360 --> 00:20:21.640
Honda!

00:20:24.010 --> 00:20:26.100
I thought you were dead.

00:20:26.100 --> 00:20:28.370
You don't know when to give up.

00:20:28.370 --> 00:20:31.970
Honda!  What’s up with you!

00:20:31.970 --> 00:20:33.380
Honda…

00:20:33.380 --> 00:20:35.660
You still don't know?

00:20:37.820 --> 00:20:38.820
Bakura!

00:20:38.820 --> 00:20:39.660
Bakura!

00:20:40.610 --> 00:20:42.660
Took you long enough.

00:20:43.920 --> 00:20:48.830
I can't see what’s going on inside the tomb.

00:20:48.830 --> 00:20:55.090
But since you're no longer inside Yugi, my other self will defeat him easily.

00:20:56.250 --> 00:20:58.370
I know what you're thinking.

00:20:58.370 --> 00:21:03.010
You want to send the Pharaoh to the tomb, but you can't.

00:21:03.010 --> 00:21:06.010
Look.  It's time for Zorc to resurrect.

00:21:07.340 --> 00:21:08.280
What?

00:21:22.650 --> 00:21:23.630
What’s going on?

00:21:23.630 --> 00:21:26.840
Zorc is resurrecting.

00:21:26.840 --> 00:21:28.720
Zorc’s resurrection?

00:21:28.720 --> 00:21:32.910
So I can’t let you leave here with that name.

00:21:32.910 --> 00:21:36.600
Only I can know the Pharaoh’s name.

00:21:39.040 --> 00:21:40.690
A Duel Disk!

00:21:40.690 --> 00:21:44.580
It's perfect for taking you on!

00:22:00.840 --> 00:22:15.460
Right now, we don't need a map

00:22:15.620 --> 00:22:31.180
The miracle that tore through the darkness is in my hand

00:22:31.900 --> 00:22:37.020
Without a goal in mind

00:22:38.340 --> 00:22:45.590
We just step towards our dream

00:22:45.980 --> 00:22:51.230
EYE'S  As you sense it

00:22:51.420 --> 00:22:59.700
Your eye will find it

00:23:00.060 --> 00:23:05.510
Oh! EYE'S  What you wish for

00:23:06.300 --> 00:23:13.650
Will touch your soul

00:23:13.840 --> 00:23:16.910
In a duel

00:23:26.730 --> 00:23:31.150
I knew something was wrong - Yami Bakura infected Honda!

00:23:31.150 --> 00:23:35.470
Revealing his true identity, Yami Bakura challenges Yugi to a duel.

00:23:35.470 --> 00:23:38.620
Don't do it, Yugi!  This duel is a Shadow Game!

00:23:38.620 --> 00:23:40.750
If you lose, you die!

00:23:40.750 --> 00:23:43.850
But Zorc has finally resurrected.

00:23:43.850 --> 00:23:47.140
The Pharaoh needs his name to defeat Zorc.

00:23:47.140 --> 00:23:50.250
So Yugi needs to win his duel?

00:23:51.080 --> 00:23:54.010
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Zorc Resurrects

00:23:54.010 --> 00:23:55.540
Duel, standby!
